            ["The charge limit, the fan curve and the controller mode can only be reset by ClawTweaks. Install it again to restore them, then come back here. You can still uninstall Center."] = "Solo ClawTweaks puede restablecer el l\u00EDmite de carga, la curva del ventilador y el modo del mando. Vuelve a instalarlo y regresa aqu\u00ED. Aun as\u00ED puedes desinstalar Center.",
